    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Ryofu Maru III cruises in the Pacific Ocean from 2018-01-11 to 2018-12-22. These data include partial pressure of carbon dioxide in the water, barometric pressure, sea surface salinity and sea surface temperature. The instruments used to collect these data include carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer, shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
